{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはっ！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、家具を買いました～あ*\\(^o^)/*ぱんぱかぱーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食器棚とか、たんすとかですっ ☆☆\n人生初の大きなお買い物です ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、中学生までお兄ちゃんと相部屋だったので\n自分の好きなお部屋に出来なくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らしを始めて、初めて自分で\n家具を購入しました(>_<)！！成長したぞっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は、貯めてたお年玉をお兄ちゃんに、奪われて\n全額使われてしまったりしたけど...(*_*)涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそんなことはないぞっ！（ 笑 ）\n頑張って少しずつお金を貯めたんだっ(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、なぜ今、家具を買うのかって...(´･-･`)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引っ越しのとき、別にいいかな～ぁと思って\n洋服くらいしか持ってこなくて、\n一年間、部屋にベットしかない状態で\n生活してたのです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、最近、「 あっコレ不便かもしれない ^o^ 」\nって、やっと気付いたからです ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて買うから、緊張して\n決めるのに2、3週間くらい悩んじゃった( ^ω^; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんから、もらったプレゼントも\nここに大切に保管させていただくつもりです(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん用の スペースを\n作るんだぁっ（＾_＾）わーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、最近、牛乳がお気に入りです（ ＾ω＾ ）もふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳も飲めなかったのが好きになって、\nよく飲んでますっ！克服っ！( ` ･_･´ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永遠のカフェオレ推しは変わらないけど、\n秋の旬の食材を使ったパンやお菓子と\n一緒だと牛乳や豆乳が美味しいんです(*^o^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近頃は、どこもかしこもパンプキンとかいっぱいだから、\nほっこりほくほくするね ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋は、ほくほくする季節だね ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん大好きっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/06/0295337/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}